{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "772497d5ec801b421323d8d93dbcd8554bd3a84f6d99d7d7e5621ac177b80fae", "ja": "明日もきっとblue sky", "zh": "明天也一定会是blue sky", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f72f9e5bf6c1bc0b3adc13885d207b2b3d50dfdc80bb1acc66941f459bdcd72c", "ja": "真美はアオを呼び出し、お互いに素直に謝り\nあうことで仲直りを果たし、離れていても\nいつでも会えると告げる。真美はアイドルだ\nから。実際、真美たちにショーを依頼したの\nは、アオの父が所属するチームだった。", "zh": "真美叫来阿守，两人坦率地互相道歉，终于重归于好，并告诉阿守，即使彼此分开，也随时都能见面。因为真美是偶像。实际上，委托真美她们表演的，正是阿守父亲所属的队伍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_1000_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_1003_ao", "source_sha256": "19523b0e0eb0384670c5c1ba45db032a3df8c20725682d236a4ea944c4e03871", "ja": "な、なに、マミ。\n久々じゃん、連絡くれたの。", "zh": "什、什么事啊，真美。好久没联系了，怎么突然联系我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_1004_012mam", "source_sha256": "b22b8321f2f8054f4ef0ae4289900b81cafedde2bdcf604313c3c3fc1713893a", "ja": "うん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_1005_ao", "source_sha256": "87d2853c1a7e9d30266b8b9077fd207c440d31b36673576f80809f4c8ad90b2d", "ja": "き、急にここに呼び出すなんてさ。\nウチ、引っ越しの準備とかあるんだけど？", "zh": "突、突然把我叫到这里来干什么啊。  \n我这边还有搬家的准备要做呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "9811d46d09c8e2a306625c4c2269e6906d554e945328984b65bc54d18fa7de43", "ja": "う、うん……。", "zh": "呃、嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "1da80247fbbd8c2252d97021f83b5f96f962c2d56fcec2cd802dd5e8d28e3768", "ja": "なんか……なんかさ。なんかその～……。\nうあうあ～！　とにかくゴメン！", "zh": "总觉得……总觉得吧。怎么说呢～……  \n呜啊呜啊～！总之对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_1008_ao", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "cb5588c9fb4a44b7a5480a862492236a5ab9069bc1f3b87bacd25630d5514a3a", "ja": "真美、やっぱ急だったからビックリしてさ。\n仕方ないのは全然わかってて、でもわかんなくて！", "zh": "真美，毕竟来得太突然了，吓了一跳嘛。\n明明完全明白这是没办法的事，可就是想不明白！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "fd26e12d7ef6f4f8b809b1336cbb81abde195de9f4dee48813558843186967a8", "ja": "なんで～とか、ヤダとか、いろんな気持ちになって、\nぐるぐるしちゃって……そんで連絡できなかった！", "zh": "因为会觉得“为什么～”“不要嘛”之类的，各种情绪搅在一起，脑子都乱成一团……所以才没能联系你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_1011_012mam", "source_sha256": "44d404339b3775c0e5a478ce91019a6819c029764ab95ec61391e2f538876c02", "ja": "でも真美ヒドイこと言ったし、あやまらなきゃ\nいけないのはわかってる！　だから、ごめん！", "zh": "可是，真美说了很过分的话，也知道自己必须道歉！所以，对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_1012_ao", "source_sha256": "1f568f32b6980c50a68d54e6a638392e223ae21e9969f133de7dd2b6896532e1", "ja": "う……ウチも！　ゴメン、引っ越しのこと、\nもっと早く言えなくて、マジでゴメン！", "zh": "呜……我也一样！抱歉，搬家的事情，\n没能更早告诉你，真的对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_1013_ao", "source_sha256": "5406a21c0a37740a6ae672649f3e941d2c2c7260b46d681d39f799e93eb42e7e", "ja": "引っ越す理由だって……ホントは、ウチのせいだし。\n母ちゃんがウチのこと、心配して……。", "zh": "搬家的理由也是……其实，都怪我。\n老妈很担心我，所以才……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_1014_ao", "source_sha256": "3460cd34e14ec93adc4848cafc7b5b63e17ad350316e526d67be5f6c0bf82bfb", "ja": "ウチの、学校のこととか……\n友達が、できん……こととか……！", "zh": "我学校里的事……  \n还有交不到朋友……之类的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_1015_012mam", "source_sha256": "ac20e7693456f0df2a336619e520cb195dd91ac962f911ba2a5e5fed92e7ae05", "ja": "ありがと！　真美もあやまれたし、アオぽんも\nあやまってくれたから、もういいよ！　これで終わり！", "zh": "谢谢！真美也道过歉了，阿茜也向我道歉了，所以已经没事啦！这下就结束了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_1016_ao", "source_sha256": "0310616179a5785949404aefa0ea6a2d550b52fb9f2a7098d9a2ca4bd9064c79", "ja": "…………。\nわかった。マミが、いいなら……いい。", "zh": "…………。\n我知道了。要是真美觉得好的话……就行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_1017_ao", "source_sha256": "7809e02a1fc1e31866b94cb9d9a1e5f20ee0147875064c21b741dc5c0a6cafda", "ja": "ホント、最後にちゃんと会えてよかった。\nスッキリしたし、ちゃんとお別れも言えるし。", "zh": "真的，最后能好好见上一面，太好了。\n心里也轻松了，还能好好道别。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_1018_ao", "source_sha256": "b0a144e90548b1c5c3ace04122ad835e31ff1a582a22e48453b80d57a7627767", "ja": "マミだけじゃなくて。\nアユムにもマコトにも、エレナにも。", "zh": "不只是真美。\n步、真，还有艾丽娜也是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_1019_034ayu", "source_sha256": "df18bd62c6d630e000344f0a34e61ea73ccdc3f7e4ef35490253391f0520c029", "ja": "いや～、それなんだけどさ～。", "zh": "哎呀～，那个啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_1020_006mak", "source_sha256": "4dd6c435706873005450c71f6a0e8324ffe414ee9020c8b3b2dab0db3f3e39e8", "ja": "これって、お別れじゃないのかも！", "zh": "这也许不是告别吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_1021_ao", "source_sha256": "cf784dc8488275797d57732539b88ede2514867c53e9f09c9da31fe5111a0ae5", "ja": "は？", "zh": "啥？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_1022_018ele", "source_sha256": "557f87c4a96a5981b2b6127e7b6c1e83c5f1120169fa0f6ebe1e168e322fba0a", "ja": "だってワタシ達は～？", "zh": "因为我们可是——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_1023_012mam", "source_sha256": "8f0774ac325e48a89b73e309ef453af70a19b4800a61a81febad3ad87fb20237", "ja": "アイドルだかんね！　テレビにもネットにも出るし、\nCMにもたくさん出るようになる！", "zh": "因为我们可是偶像嘛！不但会上电视，还会出现在网上，\n以后还会接很多广告！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_1024_012mam", "source_sha256": "79b05ace1f3cae5f90aa49bd2ea948f97c056e91ae64782f1ce285f5463e077d", "ja": "アオぽんがどこ行っても顔を見かけられるぐらいの\nアイドルになる！　そしたら、お別れじゃないっしょ？", "zh": "我要成为那种让阿欧无论走到哪里都能看到我的脸的偶像！这样一来，就不是分别了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_1025_ao", "source_sha256": "299e277a07511a1b12d1da8f4a5fcba74b7d347fa2d0e264a043ef2cfa843270", "ja": "……そっか。ははっ、そだね！\nうん、やっぱ……アイドルってスゴイよ。", "zh": "……这样啊。哈哈，也是呢！\n嗯，偶像……果然好厉害啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_1026_ao", "source_sha256": "e20be56407bb63c2318dde30bebc2be22b51fbcf5ac43421a4a737e8f0b642f6", "ja": "わかった！　ウチももうちょっと\nテレビとか見るようにする。いっぱい出ろよ！", "zh": "我知道了！我也多看看电视\n之类的吧。你可要经常出镜哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_1027_012mam", "source_sha256": "21dbaf633361f9614051d6e8cfb2d9a1c2ea6dce58f41a9e9c0be6fcf562c1ac", "ja": "うん！　めっちゃ出るから、めっちゃ見るがいいよ！\n地上波と衛星放送とケーブルと配信で4回ね！", "zh": "嗯！我会超多出场，你就尽管多看吧！\n在地面电视、卫星电视、有线电视和网络平台上播出4次哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_1028_ao", "source_sha256": "04dd665071e13df76c4ef928dfe960a88d470570b55357aae5089e85e7c27b1f", "ja": "そんなヒマじゃないし。ヤダ、1回！", "zh": "我才没那么闲。不要，1次！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_1029_006mak", "source_sha256": "7f5ce66b6a4e9c3f81f093d2374578d5e5999c4d6f03020ba8d71eab7e26b0bc", "ja": "テレビだけじゃないよ。アイドルはライブとか\nロケとか、遠征する仕事も結構あるからね♪", "zh": "不只是上电视哦。偶像还有演唱会、外景拍摄之类的工作，经常也要去外地出差呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_1030_034ayu", "source_sha256": "64ade638efb8b456c1bd484505b5d9d9d72b408b2d7cc9ef34eabcdda47bfd04", "ja": "そうそう、全国周るツアーとかやったこともあるし。\nだから、その気になれば、会いに行けるってこと！", "zh": "对对对，也有过全国巡演之类的活动嘛。\n所以，只要下定决心，就能去见你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_1031_018ele", "source_sha256": "4f0212b230cf29e6824af4f85523dd43cd2df58177cc9e4b9f54aec689b714fb", "ja": "だから今日は、もう会えなくなるお別れじゃなくて～。\n次に会う……いつかの明日までのお別れにしようネ？", "zh": "所以今天不是那种从此再也见不到的告别～  \n而是告别到下次见面……直到未来某一天，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_1032_ao", "source_sha256": "a66da240cca7a279656239c37ffb98cec7949ce41e902a0d39036c9185f7eecb", "ja": "うん……。わかった。", "zh": "嗯……知道了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_1033_012mam", "source_sha256": "88dc9eed1c9856a8a0d83c699706a7304b8a60908e03396f0a3e11b4a1b4d30c", "ja": "えへへ、それじゃ……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，那么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_06_1034_012mam", "source_sha256": "f01874864b2a3610dc8dd2000749c65601a5d323b7d4dcf3c2f6b8b9f0d63e4b", "ja": "また明日ね～！", "zh": "明天见～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
